  "description": "Lee Hu-Young, a special rookie of the professional basketball team 'HG Big Whales'. He was living a difficult life day by day to pay off his father's loan debt. When everything was burdensome and burdensome, a man appeared.\n\n *\"Are you trying to seduce me now?\"\n\n\"What you just did was seducing me, and I'm just trying to see.\"*\n\nThe short break he spent with the man was sweet, but in the harsh reality, Lee Hu-Young chose to disappear instead of continuing his relationship with the man. And he didn't know that he would meet him again a year later. And that too as the owner of HG Big Whales and a player. He thought he would be caught without anyone knowing, but the owner Eun Jun-Wook's reaction was unexpected.\n\n *\"If you need anything, tell me. I'll help you in any way I can. I'll be a bonus to you, not a flaw.\"*\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
